---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="All Situations - SolveSteps" description="Browse all situation guides with interactive tools to help you get organized and take action.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">All Situations</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12">
      Choose a situation you're dealing with right now. Each guide includes step-by-step instructions and interactive tools to help you get organized.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <a href="/situations/moving-apartment" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-blue-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🏠</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Moving to a New Apartment</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Comprehensive checklist and timeline for a smooth move. Track packing, utilities, forwarding address, and more.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/situations/weekly-cleaning-routine" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-green-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">✨</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Weekly Cleaning Routine</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Build a sustainable cleaning schedule that works for your life. Daily, weekly, and monthly tasks.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-green-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/situations/budget-reset" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-orange-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">💰</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Budget Reset</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Get back on track with your finances. Step-by-step approach to budgeting and financial planning.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-orange-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/situations/exam-study-plan" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-purple-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">📚</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Exam Study Plan</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Create an effective study schedule and stay focused. Week-by-week study guide for exam preparation.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-purple-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/situations/overwhelmed-week-planning" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-red-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🧠</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Managing an Overwhelming Week</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Prioritize and organize when everything feels too much. Learn how to triage and manage a busy week.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-red-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/situations/morning-routine-builder" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-yellow-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🌅</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Morning Routine Builder</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Design and time your ideal morning routine. Includes example routines to get you started.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-yellow-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/situations/weekend-home-reset" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-pink-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🏡</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Weekend Home Reset</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Reset your home for the week ahead. Saturday and Sunday task lists to refresh your space.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-pink-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/situations/burnout-free-week-planning" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg border-l-4 border-indigo-600 transition">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">⚡</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Burnout-Free Week Planning</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Prevent burnout with sustainable planning. Balance work, rest, and personal time effectively.</p>
        <span class="text-sm text-indigo-600 font-semibold">Get Started →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How to Use These Guides</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">1.</span>
          <span>Pick a situation that matches what you're dealing with</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">2.</span>
          <span>Read the background and tips for your situation</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">3.</span>
          <span>Use the interactive tool (checklist, planner, or routine builder)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">4.</span>
          <span>Save your progress (automatically on your device)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">5.</span>
          <span>Print or download your plan when ready</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>